Name: Render scene at cursor
Description: Render the manimR scene defined at or above the cursor and play it in the Viewer.
Binding: addin_render_scene
Interactive: false

Name: Render scene in background
Description: Render the manimR scene at the cursor as an RStudio background job, keeping the console free.
Binding: addin_render_background
Interactive: false

Name: Render all scenes in file
Description: Render every manimR scene defined in the active file.
Binding: addin_render_all
Interactive: false

Name: Preview last frame
Description: Render only the final frame of the scene at the cursor, for a quick look.
Binding: addin_last_frame
Interactive: false

Name: Insert scene template
Description: Insert a manimR scene template at the cursor.
Binding: addin_insert_template
Interactive: false

Name: Render with options
Description: Choose scene, quality, format and transparency in a dialog, then render.
Binding: manim_gadget
Interactive: true
